      },
      {
        "_uid": "38d37331-af3a-1a04-47c4-23fbfb77d463",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Figure 1: Comparison of teaching practices of faculty respondents from the faculty satisfaction survey (FSS) who have and have not attended particular QTL programmes.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Recommendations:",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "underline"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "ordered_list",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Ensuring QA programme reviews include a research and scholarship component.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Reviewing the policy on promotions and annual review by giving greater emphasis to recognizing and rewarding teaching excellence.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Ensuring strategic support for teaching with technology meets entity specific needs and that capacity is built within entities to support operational activities.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Ensuring momentum for a Teachers Academy that provides prestige to those who are excellent teachers to mentor other faculty creating a sustainable resource for QTL_net.",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The reviewers were very complementary of the progress, reach and impacts made in the 5 years since establishment stating:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"The QTL_networks have been remarkably successful in raising the profile of the importance of teaching and learning within AKU in a very short time.  They have exceeded the expectations of most educational development units in any country...The three networks are highly integrated in their work with stakeholders throughout AKU. Therefore, the Review Team would recommend that there be only one Network, QTL_net composed of three sub teams, QAI, TL and BDL.\"",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We are grateful to all those who took part in the FSS and review process. Your input and engagement helps us to serve you better.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
